###> deptrac (backend/tools/deptrac) ###
# The analyser has its own composer project so that its dependencies never join
# the application's autoloader. Its composer.json and composer.lock ARE
# committed; its vendor tree is not, exactly like the application's.
/tools/*/vendor/
# deptrac's own AST cache, written next to deptrac.yaml on every run.
/.deptrac.cache
###< deptrac ###
